  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF - Education programme in South Sudan, 2015-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to UNCEF there is an acute and growing need for support for education of the children affected by conflict in South Sudan. Currently UNICEF works with a financing deficit amounting to 12,4 mio. USD on education. Without the transfer of extra funds it will not be possible to address the massive need. UNICEF&apos;s activities in South Sudan are ensuring safe schooling of conflict affect children and youth; the establishment of safe educations facilities along with training of teachers and psychosocial support for vulnerable children.</narrative>
  </description>
